{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2019-10-15 22:30:00', 'title': 'Intel Corporation (NasdaqGS:INTC) entered into a definitive agreement to acquire Smart\xa0Edge\xa0Business from Smart Edge Business of Smart-Edge.com, Inc. for $27 million.', 'text': "Intel Corporation (NasdaqGS:INTC) entered into a definitive agreement to acquire Smart\xa0Edge\xa0Business from Smart-Edge.com, Inc. for $27 million on October 14, 2019. Intel will acquire all of the assets in cash and will assume certain specified liabilities. A portion of the purchase price will be held back by Intel at the closing as partial security for the indemnification obligations of Smart-Edge.com. In a related transaction Pivot\xa0and\xa0Intel\xa0have\xa0entered\xa0into\xa0a\xa0three-year\xa0preferred channel\xa0partner\xa0agreement\xa0which\xa0designates\xa0Pivot\xa0as\xa0a\xa0non-exclusive\xa0preferred\xa0system\xa0integrator\xa0and\xa0channel\xa0partner\xa0for\xa0Smart\xa0Edge\xa0based\xa0solutions. The agreement may be terminated any time prior to closing by mutual written consent of Intel and Smart-Edge.com. All Smart\xa0Edge\xa0employees,\xa0including\xa0Smart\xa0Edge's\xa0Chief Executive Officer,\xa0Bob\xa0Pike,\xa0will\xa0join\xa0Intel’s\xa0Network\xa0and\xa0Custom\xa0Logic\xa0Group\xa0(NCLG)\xa0once\xa0the\xa0transaction\xa0is complete. The transaction\xa0is\xa0subject\xa0to\xa0customary\xa0closing\xa0conditions, approvals and clearances of governmental entities, third party approval and employment agreements. The transaction is expected to close during the fourth quarter of 2019.\n"}
