{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2019-10-15 22:30:00', 'title': 'Wabtec Corporation Opens New Headquarters in Pittsburgh', 'text': 'Wabtec Corporation announced the grand opening of its new headquarters in Pittsburgh. The company’s origins began in Western Pennsylvania with founder George Westinghouse Jr.’s invention of the automatic air brake – a breakthrough that redefined the transportation industry and saved lives. The office will house roughly 250 employees and play a critical role in accelerating the future of transportation.'}
